profile_short_name:Filter-Origin
profile_designer:Kaelin McCowan
profile_description:Profile optimized for a light filter roast (1.2 roast level) to express origin characteristics and feature balanced acidity/sweetness.  Have been using  right after roasting or within few days of roasting. Designed to push more more heat tranfer earlier in the beans and then a gradual ROR decline and min 20% DTR.  Despite early higher heat application this profile still works well with lower available mains power.  Not recommended for roasts beyond 2.0 roast level due to low ROR at end of roast.
